        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you.\r\n\r\n2 Bedroom, 1 Bathroom End Of Terrace Home \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and LWK are delighted to present 24 Sherrard Avenue to the Dublin 1 property market. \r\nSituated in the heart of Dublin 1, 24 Sherrard Avenue is a charming two-bedroom, one-bathroom end-of-terrace home offering bright and well-proportioned accommodation in a highly convenient city-centre location. The property is well maintained throughout and benefits from on-street parking, a private courtyard and rear laneway access, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a comfortable home close to everything Dublin city centre has to offer.\r\n\r\nOn arrival, you are presented with a well-maintained end-of-terrace property. Upon entering, you are welcomed into a warm and inviting open-plan living area, which features a stylish electric feature fireplace and a large window overlooking the front of the property. The room is bright and comfortable, providing an excellent space for both relaxing and entertaining.\r\n\r\nMoving through the home, you enter the kitchen, which offers an abundance of useful base and eye-level storage. A large sliding door allows plenty of natural light to flood the space while also providing direct access to the private courtyard. The courtyard offers a pleasant outdoor area and, together with the property's access to the rear laneway, adds to the practicality of the home.\r\n\r\nThe main bathroom has been recently renovated and is finished with high-quality contemporary fixtures and fittings, creating a modern and stylish space.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two bright and airy bedrooms. The bedroom to the front of the property is well proportioned and benefits from good natural light, while the larger rear bedroom provides generous accommodation and includes fitted wardrobe space, offering excellent storage.\r\n\r\nThe location is one of the property's major attractions. Situated in Dublin 1, Sherrard Avenue is within easy reach of Dublin city centre and is surrounded by an excellent selection of local amenities. A wide variety of shops, cafés, restaurants, pubs and everyday services are available within walking distance, while the nearby Parnell Street, O'Connell Street and Capel Street areas provide an extensive choice of retail, dining and entertainment options. The Mater Hospital is also close by, making the property particularly appealing to medical  and hospital staff.\r\n\r\nThe surrounding area is well served by a number of schools and educational facilities, with primary and secondary schools available within the wider Dublin 1 and Dublin 7 areas. The nearby Phibsborough and Drumcondra areas also offer a broad selection of established schools, colleges and educational facilities.\r\n\r\nTransport links are excellent, with numerous Dublin Bus routes operating close to the property and providing convenient connections throughout the city and suburbs. The property is also within walking distance of the Luas Green Line at Parnell and the wider city-centre transport network, while Drumcondra railway station is also accessible. Dublin Airport can be reached easily by road, and the M1 and M50 motorway networks provide convenient access to the wider Dublin area and beyond.\r\n\r\nOverall, 24 Sherrard Avenue represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained two-bedroom city home in a superb central location. With its bright accommodation, recently renovated bathroom, generous kitchen storage, private courtyard, rear laneway access and on-street parking, the property offers comfortable and convenient city living within easy reach of Dublin's many amenities.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation and excellent location this property has to offer.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
